      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "ZIPPER MOON (8) was well fancied in betting last start but could only manage one length away in second (30.25). Has never been out of the placings from two starts out of this box. Likely to be in the finish again. JUNGLE HOLLIE (5) is a capable type and proved too strong last time to win by 2.25 lengths at this track in a handy 29.87 beating Indy's Shine. Comes out of a solid form race last start. Can make it two on the bounce. PIECE OF CAKE (7) settled well off the leaders but kept coming to finish third over 520m at this track in 30.68 last time. Likely to enjoy the staying trip for the first time. Expecting another good run. ENVENOMATED (4) with some luck can improve on an unplaced run last time here.",
